{"type": "answer", "text": "The documentation does not say Moss is GDPR compliant, and it names no EU hosting region. GDPR is not mentioned anywhere I found. The only related items are on the Pricing & Limits page: SOC 2, HIPAA and 'Data residency / VPC deploy' are listed as Enterprise-plan only (Developer, Hobbyist (/mo) and Startup (/mo) do not include them), with VPC/on-prem as an add-on. The Plans and pricing page lists 'Advanced compliance requirements' and security reviews under Enterprise. For GDPR status or EU data residency, contact Moss about an Enterprise plan."}
